{
  "page": 580,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5617,
      "text": "Dan pada sebagian dari malam, maka bersujudlah kepada-Nya dan bertasbihlah kepada-Nya pada bagian yang panjang di malam hari.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5618,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya mereka (orang kafir) itu mencintai kehidupan (dunia) dan meningggalkan hari yang berat (hari akhirat) di belakangnya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5619,
      "text": "Kami telah menciptakan mereka dan menguatkan persendian tubuh mereka. Tetapi, jika Kami menghendaki, Kami dapat mengganti dengan yang serupa mereka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5620,
      "text": "Sungguh, (ayat-ayat) ini adalah peringatan, maka barang siapa menghendaki (kebaikan bagi dirinya) tentu dia mengambil jalan menuju kepada Tuhannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5621,
      "text": "Tetapi kamu tidak mampu (menempuh jalan itu) kecuali apabila dikehendaki Allah. Sungguh, Allah Maha Mengetahui, Mahabijaksana.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5622,
      "text": "Dia memasukkan siapa pun yang Dia kehendaki ke dalam rahmat-Nya (surga). Adapun bagi orang-orang zalim disediakan-Nya azab yang pedih.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5623,
      "text": "Demi (malaikat-malaikat)885) yang diutus untuk membawa kebaikan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5624,
      "text": "dan (malaikat-malaikat) yang terbang dengan kencangnya,886)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5625,
      "text": "dan (malaikat-malaikat) yang menyebarkan (rahmat Allah) dengan seluas-luasnya,887)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5626,
      "text": "dan (malaikat-malaikat) yang membedakan (antara yang baik dan yang buruk) dengan sejelas-jelasnya,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5627,
      "text": "dan (malaikat-malaikat) yang menyampaikan wahyu,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5628,
      "text": "untuk menolak alasan-alasan atau memberi peringatan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5629,
      "text": "Sungguh, apa yang dijanjikan kepadamu pasti terjadi.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5630,
      "text": "Maka apabila bintang-bintang dihapuskan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5631,
      "text": "dan apabila langit terbelah,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5632,
      "text": "dan apabila gunung-gunung dihancurkan menjadi debu,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5633,
      "text": "dan apabila rasul-rasul telah ditetapkan waktunya.888)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5634,
      "text": "(Niscaya dikatakan kepada mereka), \"Sampai hari apakah ditangguhkan (azab orang-orang kafir itu)?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5635,
      "text": "Sampai hari keputusan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5636,
      "text": "Dan tahukah kamu apakah hari keputusan itu?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5637,
      "text": "Celakalah pada hari itu, bagi mereka yang mendustakan (kebenaran).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5638,
      "text": "Bukankah telah Kami binasakan orang-orang yang dahulu?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5639,
      "text": "Lalu Kami susulkan (azab Kami terhadap) orang-orang yang datang kemudian.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5640,
      "text": "Demikianlah Kami perlakukan orang-orang yang berdosa.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 580,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5641,
      "text": "Celakalah pada hari itu, bagi mereka yang mendustakan (kebenaran).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
